he gave the name Ross Turner.

453
00:25:11.026 --> 00:25:12.959
His name is not Ross Turner.

454
00:25:12.994 --> 00:25:14.374
His name is Terry Boyle.

455
00:25:14.409 --> 00:25:17.619
Is that your name.
then. Terry Boyle?

456
00:25:20.967 --> 00:25:24.177
For the DIR.
the Suspect is nodding.

457
00:25:24.212 --> 00:25:27.042
Why did you say your name
was Ross Turner?

458
00:25:27.077 --> 00:25:28.606
My client's been clear.

459
00:25:28.630 --> 00:25:29.873
His name is not Ross Turner.

460
00:25:29.907 --> 00:25:31.322
His name is Terry Boyle.

461
00:25:31.357 --> 00:25:34.153
Okay. We'll look into that.

462
00:25:34.187 --> 00:25:36.327
Moving on.

463
00:25:36.362 --> 00:25:38.985
The property
where you were arrested.

464
00:25:39.020 --> 00:25:42.057
- Flat 4 - F. Beechwood House.

465
00:25:42.092 --> 00:25:43.576
Is that where you live?

466
00:25:45.647 --> 00:25:48.374
Do you live in the property
or were you just visiting?

467
00:25:50.928 --> 00:25:53.655
- No.
- No. you don't live there

468
00:25:53.690 --> 00:25:55.692
or no you weren't visiting?

469
00:25:56.934 --> 00:25:59.178
Mr Boyle has provided me
with his address.

470
00:25:59.212 --> 00:26:00.869
He does not reside
at Beechwood House.

471
00:26:00.904 --> 00:26:03.665
He resides
in the Kingsgate area.

472
00:26:03.700 --> 00:26:05.633
Flat B. Dorton Villas.

473
00:26:05.667 --> 00:26:09.153
<i>Okay. we'll look
into that as well.</i>

474
00:26:09.188 --> 00:26:11.811
<i>Interestingly.
the Kingsgate area</i>

475
00:26:11.846 --> 00:26:15.850
is where a journalist called
Gail Vella lived.

476
00:26:15.884 --> 00:26:17.921
Do you know
who I'm talking about?

477
00:26:20.751 --> 00:26:22.304
Suspect nodded.

478
00:26:22.339 --> 00:26:24.134
Thank you.

479
00:26:26.654 --> 00:26:28.725
For the DIR.
I'm showing the suspect

480
00:26:28.759 --> 00:26:31.451
item reference RCG-6.

481
00:26:31.486 --> 00:26:33.281
RCG-6 is a press cutting

482
00:26:33.315 --> 00:26:35.801
featuring an image
of Gail Vella.

483
00:26:35.835 --> 00:26:40.115
I'm also showing the suspect
item reference RCG-7.

484
00:26:40.150 --> 00:26:42.048
another press cutting
featuring an image

485
00:26:42.083 --> 00:26:45.707
of Gail Vella.
and item reference RCG-8.

486
00:26:45.742 --> 00:26:47.122
also a press cutting

487
00:26:47.157 --> 00:26:49.193
featuring an image
of Gail Vella.

488
00:26:49.228 --> 00:26:52.162
Do you recognise
these press cuttings?

489
00:27:00.515 --> 00:27:04.312
For the DIR. the suspect
is not responding.

490
00:27:04.346 --> 00:27:07.004
Do you recognise this woman?

491
00:27:08.316 --> 00:27:12.216
For the DIR.
the suspect is nodding.

492
00:27:12.251 --> 00:27:14.840
What's your relationship
to this woman?

493
00:27:14.874 --> 00:27:16.738
Nice lady.

494
00:27:20.846 --> 00:27:23.780
<i>Suspect answered. nice lady.</i>

495
00:27:31.891 --> 00:27:33.962
MIT have put the IDs
of the Armed Robbers

496
00:27:33.997 --> 00:27:36.344
up on the database.

497
00:27:36.378 --> 00:27:38.277
Have a look at this.

498
00:27:55.156 --> 00:27:57.365
- This it?
- Exactly.

499
00:27:57.399 --> 00:27:58.894
Between them these guys
have never robbed

500
00:27:58.918 --> 00:28:00.506
