than their local Greggs.

501
00:28:00.540 --> 00:28:02.208
And they just happen
to be on the exact route

502
00:28:02.232 --> 00:28:03.854
and time of an op
to bring in a suspect

503
00:28:03.889 --> 00:28:05.822
in an unsolved murder.

504
00:28:05.856 --> 00:28:07.824
Based on Officer J.'s statement.

505
00:28:07.858 --> 00:28:09.929
the MIT convoy
was travelling up hill.

506
00:28:09.964 --> 00:28:12.449
past this parade of shops.

507
00:28:12.483 --> 00:28:14.002
Well. where's the bookies?

508
00:28:14.037 --> 00:28:16.039
It's around the corner.

509
00:28:21.458 --> 00:28:23.978
It's already
a narrow line of sight.

510
00:28:24.012 --> 00:28:27.326
You add in Davidson's convoy
travelling at high speed.

511
00:28:29.397 --> 00:28:31.168
I'll call in for the footage
off the security camera.

512
00:28:31.192 --> 00:28:33.263
You go and check out
the camera in the bookies.

513
00:28:33.297 --> 00:28:35.265
Sarge.

514
00:28:58.322 --> 00:29:01.118
DI Fleming. MIT.
visiting Terry Boyle's flat.

515
00:29:01.153 --> 00:29:03.086
- Ma'am.
- Thanks.

516
00:29:22.277 --> 00:29:25.142
Hi. any updates.

517
00:29:25.177 --> 00:29:27.489
So far. apart
from the pics on the walls.

518
00:29:27.524 --> 00:29:29.284
we're not finding much
evidence of this

519
00:29:29.319 --> 00:29:31.148
being anyone's
permanent residence

520
00:29:31.183 --> 00:29:33.530
let alone the suspect's.

521
00:29:34.531 --> 00:29:36.809
The place is clean.

522
00:29:36.844 --> 00:29:38.431
Extremely clean.

523
00:29:38.466 --> 00:29:40.295
Ta.

524
00:29:59.487 --> 00:30:01.007
So. the suspect's
alleged address

525
00:30:01.040 --> 00:30:03.422
contained even more
Gail Vella images.

526
00:30:03.456 --> 00:30:06.977
And neighbours positively
ID'd his picture.

527
00:30:07.012 --> 00:30:08.644
Meanwhile we've interviewed
a number of residents

528
00:30:08.668 --> 00:30:10.084
at Beechwood House.

529
00:30:10.118 --> 00:30:12.845
Whoever lived in Flat F
kept himself to himself.

530
00:30:12.880 --> 00:30:14.271
And the few
that did notice a resident

531
00:30:14.295 --> 00:30:17.574
describe him
as dark-haired and stocky.

532
00:30:17.608 --> 00:30:19.887
Like Terry Boyle.

533
00:30:19.921 --> 00:30:21.681
What we really need
is the CHIS to confirm

534
00:30:21.716 --> 00:30:23.891
whether Terry Boyle
was the man that confessed

535
00:30:23.925 --> 00:30:25.616
to an involvement
in Gail Vella's murder.

536
00:30:25.651 --> 00:30:28.033
or it was someone else entirely.

537
00:30:28.067 --> 00:30:29.413
Tell me about it.

538
00:30:29.448 --> 00:30:31.933
My patience is all used up.

539
00:30:31.968 --> 00:30:34.108
Set up an urgent meet
with the CHIS's Handler.

540
00:30:34.142 --> 00:30:35.488
Cheers. Boss.

541
00:30:45.050 --> 00:30:47.052
Boss.
this is the CHIS's Handler.

542
00:30:47.086 --> 00:30:48.950
I've brought him up
to speed on our inquiry.

543
00:30:48.985 --> 00:30:50.227
DS Marks.

544
00:30:50.262 --> 00:30:52.195
DCI Davidson.

545
00:30:52.229 --> 00:30:54.507
You'll have heard from Kate
how important it is for us

546
00:30:54.542 --> 00:30:57.234
to acquire your CHIS's intel.

547
00:30:57.269 --> 00:30:59.305
I'm doing everything I can.

548
00:30:59.340 --> 00:31:01.583
I don't know
what more you expect.

549
00:31:01.618 --> 00:31:04.034
For a start you could help us
locate your CHIS.

550
00:31:04.069 --> 00:31:05.391
I've been trying
to make contact with him.

551
00:31:05.415 --> 00:31:06.968
He's gone to ground.

552
00:31:07.003 --> 00:31:08.280
Then no disrespect. mate.

553
00:31:08.314 --> 00:31:11.524
but we've got the resources
to find him.

554
00:31:11.559 --> 00:31:14.527
You're asking me to disclose
his identity?

555
00:31:14.562 --> 00:31:16.322
You know I can't do that.

556
00:31:16.357 --> 00:31:18.877
Is the word "ma'am"
in your vocabulary?

557
00:31:20.085 --> 00:31:21.672
To locate your CHIS
and convey him

558
00:31:21.707 --> 00:31:23.157
to a place of safety from which

559
00:31:23.191 --> 00:31:24.434
he can assist our inquiry.

560
00:31:24.468 --> 00:31:27.540
we need you to disclose
his identity.

561
00:31:27.575 --> 00:31:29.301
No.

562
00:31:29.335 --> 00:31:30.612
Ma'am.

563
00:31:38.275 --> 00:31:39.725
Are you worried about him?

564
00:31:39.759 --> 00:31:42.107
Yes. Of course. I am!

565
00:31:44.178 --> 00:31:46.111
I'm sorry Sarge.

566
00:32:03.991 --> 00:32:06.062
<i>You've reached PS Farida Jatri.</i>

567
00:32:06.096 --> 00:32:08.064
<i>Please leave a message.</i>

568
00:32:08.098 --> 00:32:09.789
Farida. it's Steve Arnott.

569
00:32:09.824 --> 00:32:11.377
Look. we're progressing
the inquiry.

570
00:32:11.412 --> 00:32:14.104
but I need your help
to fill in some of the gaps.

571
00:32:14.139 --> 00:32:16.520
Call me when you can. okay?

572
00:32:16.555 --> 00:32:18.246
Thank you.

573
00:32:46.585 --> 00:32:48.483
MIT. DI Fleming.

574
00:32:49.726 --> 00:32:51.555
Thanks for calling me
back Sarge.

575
00:32:53.212 --> 00:32:54.800
How do you spell that?

576
00:32:54.834 --> 00:32:56.733
Jo.

577
00:33:00.219 --> 00:33:01.807
Sir.

578
00:33:01.841 --> 00:33:03.429
The Chief Constable's been on.

579
00:33:03.464 --> 00:33:05.776
I said I'll call back
with an update.

580
00:33:05.811 --> 00:33:07.640
Too early to say. sir.

581
00:33:07.675 --> 00:33:10.091
I should have been back home
ages ago. my feet up.

582
00:33:10.126 --> 00:33:11.817
Have you got our man or not?

583
00:33:11.851 --> 00:33:15.062
Like I said. sir.
too early to say.

584
00:33:15.096 --> 00:33:16.787
We'll need another
twelve hours with him.

585
00:33:16.822 --> 00:33:19.135
Ah for God's sake.

586
00:33:19.169 --> 00:33:21.482
We've hit a bit
of a brick wall. sir.

587
00:33:21.516 --> 00:33:24.830
The CHIS.
he's dropped off the radar.

588
00:33:36.807 --> 00:33:39.051
If this is going to go
the way we want.

589
00:33:39.086 --> 00:33:41.053
we need to find out who he is.

590
00:33:46.610 --> 00:33:48.198
We've got a job to do.

591
00:33:48.233 --> 00:33:50.166
The Handler's
within his rights not to.

592
00:33:50.200 --> 00:33:51.443
Fuck the Handler.

593
00:33:51.477 --> 00:33:53.100
And fuck the CHIS.

594
00:33:57.138 --> 00:34:00.279
Okay. Any chance you
could scan over the paperwork?

595
00:34:03.834 --> 00:34:06.630
Suspect's been bedded down
for a rest period.

596
00:34:06.665 --> 00:34:07.918
Not much more happening tonight.

597
00:34:07.942 --> 00:34:09.323
I might leave soon.

598
00:34:09.357 --> 00:34:11.325
I was thinking the same.

599
00:34:11.359 --> 00:34:13.120
No worries
you've been a big help.

600
00:34:13.154 --> 00:34:15.363
Okay. Thanks. Bye.

601
00:34:17.917 --> 00:34:19.298
Sorry. boss.

602
00:34:19.333 --> 00:34:20.817
What's up?

603
00:34:25.753 --> 00:34:27.627
I've taken reports
from the Surveillance Teams

604
00:34:27.651 --> 00:34:29.239
<i>in situ</i> at Beechwood House

605
00:34:29.274 --> 00:34:31.241
where Terry Boyle was arrested.

606
00:34:31.276 --> 00:34:33.278
When we were diverted
to the Armed Robbery.

607
00:34:33.312 --> 00:34:34.762
there was some confusion

608
00:34:34.796 --> 00:34:36.522
over the Surveillance Authority.

609
00:34:36.557 --> 00:34:38.490
What confusion?

610
00:34:39.629 --> 00:34:41.217
Well. the team was only in place

611
00:34:41.251 --> 00:34:43.667
under Directed Authority.
and it got queried

612
00:34:43.702 --> 00:34:45.911
as requiring Intrusive Authority

613
00:34:45.945 --> 00:34:48.293
because they were using
extreme high-power lenses

614
00:34:48.327 --> 00:34:50.260
to view inside the property.

615
00:34:50.295 --> 00:34:51.917
Shit.

616
00:34:51.951 --> 00:34:55.438
Yeah. Which means they had to
pull out until it was sorted.

617
00:34:57.233 --> 00:35:00.926
Looks like the Super
messed up the paperwork.

618
00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:04.481
How long was Beechwood House
not under surveillance?

619
00:35:04.516 --> 00:35:06.311
Three and a half hours.

620
00:35:08.658 --> 00:35:10.798
Which means...

621
00:35:10.832 --> 00:35:13.939
we don't know if Terry Boyle
is this person

622
00:35:13.973 --> 00:35:16.286
or this person was able
to flee the property

623
00:35:16.321 --> 00:35:19.393
during the absence
of surveillance.

624
00:35:19.427 --> 00:35:21.291
I see.

625
00:35:21.326 --> 00:35:25.433
We'll have to factor that
into our thinking.

626
00:35:25.468 --> 00:35:28.747
I haven't shared this
with anyone else. boss.

627
00:35:28.781 --> 00:35:30.783
Thanks. Kate.

628
00:35:30.818 --> 00:35:32.440
Someone comes
from Anticorruption

629
00:35:32.475 --> 00:35:34.753
you worry they're not
going to be a team player.

630
00:35:34.787 --> 00:35:36.720
I got fed up of nicking coppers.

631
00:35:36.755 --> 00:35:40.276
I'd rather go after the psycho
that murdered Gail.

632
00:35:40.310 --> 00:35:41.932
Cheers. boss.

633
00:36:05.370 --> 00:36:07.268
What have we got?

634
00:36:08.545 --> 00:36:10.547
Based on the claims
made by Officer J.

635
00:36:10.582 --> 00:36:11.893
DCI Davidson ordered the convoy

636
00:36:11.928 --> 00:36:13.354
to attend the armed robbery
on the grounds

637
00:36:13.378 --> 00:36:15.276
there was an urgent threat
to the public.

638
00:36:15.311 --> 00:36:16.622
Fair enough.

639
00:36:16.657 --> 00:36:18.013
This is the Getaway Van
that triggered

640
00:36:18.037 --> 00:36:19.901
DCI Davidson's suspicions.

641
00:36:21.972 --> 00:36:25.528
And these are the MIT vehicles
passing through at high speed.

642
00:36:25.562 --> 00:36:27.944
This. according to Officer J..

643
00:36:27.978 --> 00:36:30.222
is the moment Davidson
made her decision.

644
00:36:31.568 --> 00:36:33.432
But that convoy
was going like the clappers.

645
00:36:33.467 --> 00:36:35.296
You'd do well to spot
a pipe band in there.

646
00:36:35.331 --> 00:36:39.335
I agree. sir. that's why
we need more evidence.

647
00:36:39.369 --> 00:36:42.510
But you have an informant
on the team. right.

648
00:36:42.545 --> 00:36:43.970
She's not responded
to any of my efforts

649
00:36:43.994 --> 00:36:46.065
to make further contact.

650
00:36:46.100 --> 00:36:48.067
Gonna need more. son.

651
00:36:48.102 --> 00:36:50.932
Kate's Davidson's Deputy SIO.

652
00:36:50.967 --> 00:36:53.659
If anyone's got
the inside track. it's her.

653
00:36:53.694 --> 00:36:55.282
I am aware.

654
00:36:55.316 --> 00:36:57.387
No one's better qualified
or better positioned

655
00:36:57.422 --> 00:37:01.080
to act as a CHIS or even a UCO.

656
00:37:01.115 --> 00:37:02.910
I'll give it some thought.

657
00:37:02.944 --> 00:37:05.430
Carry on.

658
00:37:05.464 --> 00:37:07.432
Sir.

659
00:38:38.730 --> 00:38:42.147
Boss. Ma'am.

660
00:38:42.181 --> 00:38:45.357
Pathologist says
he died instantly.

661
00:38:45.392 --> 00:38:47.670
The pattern of injuries
implies a fall from height.

662
00:38:51.087 --> 00:38:53.883
Okay. have we confirmed ID yet?

663
00:38:53.917 --> 00:38:57.162
I took the liberty of sending
a photo to the Handler.

664
00:38:58.508 --> 00:39:00.510
He confirms it's the CHIS.

665
00:39:03.996 --> 00:39:05.722
Shit.

666
00:39:18.494 --> 00:39:20.012
Sorry. boss.

667
00:39:20.047 --> 00:39:21.911
Got the file on the CHIS.

668
00:39:21.945 --> 00:39:24.154
Low-level offender
named Alastair Oldroyd.

669
00:39:24.189 --> 00:39:26.191
Unfortunately.
there's nothing on CCTV

670
00:39:26.225 --> 00:39:28.987
so whatever happened to him.
happened in a blind spot.

671
00:39:29.021 --> 00:39:31.886
Door-to-door haven't found
any witnesses to the fall.

672
00:39:32.887 --> 00:39:34.406
Right.

673
00:39:34.441 --> 00:39:37.478
A number of people
do report hearing a scream.

674
00:39:37.513 --> 00:39:40.964
Suggests he was pushed.
but not conclusively.

675
00:39:40.999 --> 00:39:43.173
Either way.
we've lost the only person

676
00:39:43.208 --> 00:39:45.452
that can say for certain
if Terry Boyle claimed

677
00:39:45.486 --> 00:39:47.177
to have been involved
in Gail's murder

678
00:39:47.212 --> 00:39:48.800
or it was someone else.

679
00:39:48.834 --> 00:39:50.526
Yep.

680
00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:52.907
If only we'd have been
given his ID.

681
00:39:52.942 --> 00:39:54.633
we might have been able
to have saved him.

682
00:39:54.668 --> 00:39:58.188
Exactly.

683
00:39:58.223 --> 00:39:59.811
Cheers boss.

684
00:40:22.661 --> 00:40:24.663
Steve Arnott.

685
00:40:26.803 --> 00:40:29.703
Farida. are you okay?

686
00:40:29.737 --> 00:40:31.843
What's happened?

687
00:40:31.877 --> 00:40:34.466
Our most important witness
was just found dead.

688
00:40:34.501 --> 00:40:36.675
What witness?

689
00:40:36.710 --> 00:40:38.228
This is too dangerous.

690
00:40:38.263 --> 00:40:40.161
Wait.

691
00:40:40.196 --> 00:40:42.543
you're not suggesting
Davidson was involved?

692
00:40:42.578 --> 00:40:45.132
You have no idea
what she's capable of.

693
00:40:45.166 --> 00:40:46.651
none at all.

694
00:40:48.135 --> 00:40:50.758
Don't call me again.

695
00:41:01.666 --> 00:41:04.116
Second MIT interview
of Terry Boyle

696
00:41:04.151 --> 00:41:07.223
by DCI Davidson and DS Lomax.

697
00:41:07.257 --> 00:41:10.744
Mr Boyle.
you remain under caution.

698
00:41:10.778 --> 00:41:12.331
Please refer to Document 36

699
00:41:12.366 --> 00:41:13.885
submitted in Disclosure.

700
00:41:13.919 --> 00:41:17.578
Document 36 is a report
regarding fingerprints

701
00:41:17.613 --> 00:41:20.339
-detected at Flat 4
-F
Beechwood House

702
00:41:20.374 --> 00:41:23.204
during a lawful search
on 27th October.

703
00:41:23.239 --> 00:41:25.206
A number of said prints
match the fingerprints

704
00:41:25.241 --> 00:41:28.347
obtained from Mr Boyle
following his arrest.

705
00:41:28.382 --> 00:41:30.833
A significant number
of other fingerprints

706
00:41:30.867 --> 00:41:32.524
match an individual identified

707
00:41:32.559 --> 00:41:34.284
by the Police National Computer

708
00:41:34.319 --> 00:41:36.563
as Carl Banks.

709
00:41:38.944 --> 00:41:40.197
<i>Terry. what is your relationship</i>

710
00:41:40.221 --> 00:41:41.671
<i>with Carl Banks?</i>

711
00:41:43.673 --> 00:41:45.641
<i>Do you know Carl Banks?</i>

712
00:41:46.676 --> 00:41:48.678
No comment.

713
00:41:51.716 --> 00:41:53.614
You sure that's how
you want to answer?

714
00:41:54.926 --> 00:41:58.136
Can you tell us
who is Carl Banks?

715
00:41:58.170 --> 00:41:59.976
<i>I suggest you arrest Mr Banks</i>

716
00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:02.899
and put that question to him
rather than to my client.

717
00:42:02.934 --> 00:42:06.178
So far we've been unable
to trace Carl Banks.

718
00:42:06.213 --> 00:42:08.042
Perhaps your client
will provide information

719
00:42:08.077 --> 00:42:10.113
that will help us locate him.

720
00:42:12.288 --> 00:42:15.325
For the DIR.
the suspect is not responding.

721
00:42:15.360 --> 00:42:18.846
Document 42 submitted
in Disclosure.

722
00:42:18.881 --> 00:42:20.986
For the DIR. Document 42

723
00:42:21.021 --> 00:42:23.264
is a report
on chemical traces detected

724
00:42:23.299 --> 00:42:26.889
in Flat B Dorton Villas
on 28th of October.

725
00:42:26.923 --> 00:42:30.651
Said traces have been
identified as cleaning fluids.

726
00:42:32.170 --> 00:42:34.966
Did you carry out a thorough
cleaning of the premises

727
00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:37.106
in order to destroy
forensic evidence?

728
00:42:43.112 --> 00:42:46.184
For the DIR.
the suspect is not responding.

729
00:42:46.218 --> 00:42:50.119
<i>Image 27 submitted
for Disclosure.</i>

730
00:42:50.153 --> 00:42:52.362
Image 27 is a crime scene
photograph

731
00:42:52.397 --> 00:42:54.399
captured during a lawful search

732
00:42:54.433 --> 00:42:57.851
of Flat B Dorton Villas
on 28th of October

733
00:42:57.885 --> 00:42:59.887
showing the kitchen area.

734
00:42:59.922 --> 00:43:02.131
Markings on the floor
suggest a large appliance

735
00:43:02.165 --> 00:43:04.202
had been present for some time.

736
00:43:04.236 --> 00:43:07.688
Please cross-reference
with Document 42:

737
00:43:07.723 --> 00:43:09.000
chemical traces detected

738
00:43:09.034 --> 00:43:11.416
resembling refrigerator coolant.

739
00:43:11.450 --> 00:43:14.108
Our assumption is the removal

740
00:43:14.143 --> 00:43:17.111
of a refrigerator or freezer.

741
00:43:17.146 --> 00:43:19.907
What happened to this appliance?

742
00:43:21.909 --> 00:43:23.255
I don't know.

743
00:43:26.707 --> 00:43:28.916
<i>Document 42 again.</i>

744
00:43:28.951 --> 00:43:31.091
<i>Further chemical traces
were detected</i>

745
00:43:31.125 --> 00:43:33.783
<i>which have been identified
as two substances</i>

746
00:43:33.818 --> 00:43:36.993
<i>listed under the Misuse
of Drugs Act in Class A:</i>

747
00:43:37.028 --> 00:43:39.237
<i>cocaine and diamorphine.</i>

748
00:43:39.271 --> 00:43:42.067
<i>Diamorphine is
commonly known as "heroin".</i>

749
00:43:42.102 --> 00:43:45.450
Have you ever used
these substances?

750
00:43:52.146 --> 00:43:54.424
Do you have an explanation
for why these substances

751
00:43:54.459 --> 00:43:57.807
were detected in your flat?

752
00:43:57.842 --> 00:43:59.740
No comment.

753
00:43:59.775 --> 00:44:01.466
These are powerful substances.

754
00:44:01.500 --> 00:44:03.502
Even in small quantities.

755
00:44:03.537 --> 00:44:06.229
they can affect mood and memory.

756
00:44:06.264 --> 00:44:09.992
They can cause unpredictable.
violent behaviour.

757
00:44:13.236 --> 00:44:16.688
Images 20 to 22.

758
00:44:16.723 --> 00:44:20.519
Images 20 to 22
are photos of Gail Vella

759
00:44:20.554 --> 00:44:22.901
found in Flat B Dorton Villas

760
00:44:22.936 --> 00:44:25.870
during a lawful search
on 28th of October.

761
00:44:25.904 --> 00:44:28.010
Document 44 submitted in...

762
00:44:28.044 --> 00:44:29.494
May I interject?

763
00:44:29.528 --> 00:44:31.161
You've presented evidence
of intense cleaning

764
00:44:31.185 --> 00:44:32.531
at my client's home.

765
00:44:32.566 --> 00:44:34.164
Why. then. would these
incriminating images

766
00:44:34.188 --> 00:44:36.259
have been left behind?

767
00:44:36.294 --> 00:44:40.160
Document 44 submitted
in Disclosure.

768
00:44:40.194 --> 00:44:43.784
Document 44 describes
deposits of semen

769
00:44:43.819 --> 00:44:46.718
detected on said images
of Gail Vella.

770
00:44:46.753 --> 00:44:48.927
Analysis of these deposits
of semen

771
00:44:48.962 --> 00:44:51.516
gives a 99.9% probability

772
00:44:51.550 --> 00:44:54.174
that they originated
from your client.

773
00:44:59.282 --> 00:45:03.252
Did you want to have sexual
relations with Gail Vella?

774
00:45:03.286 --> 00:45:05.737
<i>Did you want her
to be your girlfriend?</i>

775
00:45:07.601 --> 00:45:10.880
For the DIR.
the suspect is not responding.

776
00:45:10.915 --> 00:45:14.332
Did you become angry
or frustrated?

777
00:45:14.366 --> 00:45:17.197
Did it make you want
to hurt Gail?

778
00:45:17.231 --> 00:45:20.269
For the DIR.
the suspect is not responding.

779
00:45:23.237 --> 00:45:26.068
<i>I'm showing the suspect
an image of an article</i>

780
00:45:26.102 --> 00:45:29.278
<i>of clothing. BC-9. recovered</i>

781
00:45:29.312 --> 00:45:30.555
from Flat B Dorton Villas

782
00:45:30.589 --> 00:45:33.351
on 28th of October.

783
00:45:33.385 --> 00:45:37.010
Document 60 submitted
in Disclosure.

784
00:45:37.044 --> 00:45:39.081
Document 60 is a report

785
00:45:39.115 --> 00:45:41.428
of particles of gunshot residue

786
00:45:41.462 --> 00:45:43.810
detected on BC-9.

787
00:45:45.052 --> 00:45:47.952
Mr Boyle.
did you shoot Gail Vella?

788
00:46:31.478 --> 00:46:33.100
What kind of nobby signal
was that?

789
00:46:33.135 --> 00:46:34.964
First thing that came to mind.

790
00:46:34.999 --> 00:46:37.311
Go round the block.
in case anyone's watching.

791
00:46:37.346 --> 00:46:39.451
No worries.

792
00:46:45.043 --> 00:46:47.287
There's a nice little balti
up the road

793
00:46:47.321 --> 00:46:49.058
but I'm guessing that's not
why you're here though.

794
00:46:49.082 --> 00:46:51.981
I wish. Sorry. mate.

795
00:46:52.016 --> 00:46:53.327
Right.

796
00:46:53.362 --> 00:46:54.846
I can't share any details.

797
00:46:54.881 --> 00:46:56.399
but we might be looking
into Vella.

798
00:46:56.434 --> 00:46:59.126
Oh shit.

799
00:46:59.161 --> 00:47:01.059
Great. so when Buckells
and Davidson find out

800
00:47:01.094 --> 00:47:02.899
- they're gonna think...
- They'll think either

801
00:47:02.923 --> 00:47:05.029
you're our CHIS or you've
been embedded as a UCO.

802
00:47:05.063 --> 00:47:07.169
That's why I'm giving you
a heads-up. Kate.

803
00:47:07.203 --> 00:47:09.250
Steve. you know what it's like
being ex-anticorruption.

804
00:47:09.274 --> 00:47:11.345
I've had to work my bollocks
off for them lot.

805
00:47:11.380 --> 00:47:13.013
Is this the Gaffer's way
of getting his own back?

806
00:47:13.037 --> 00:47:14.521
No. of course not.

807
00:47:14.555 --> 00:47:16.281
Why am I still
calling him Gaffer?

808
00:47:16.316 --> 00:47:18.111
He knows why you moved on.

809
00:47:18.145 --> 00:47:19.595
Yeah. that's what worries me.

810
00:47:19.629 --> 00:47:22.943
AC-12 was tainted when
the Gaffer got investigated.

811
00:47:22.978 --> 00:47:24.334
Look. you've done your time.
made DI.

812
00:47:24.358 --> 00:47:25.877
You wanted to move on.

813
00:47:25.912 --> 00:47:27.396
He knows
it was nothing personal.

814
00:47:27.430 --> 00:47:29.294
Except you stayed.

815
00:47:33.609 --> 00:47:35.024
So what next?

816
00:47:35.059 --> 00:47:36.646
You opening an official inquiry?

817
00:47:36.681 --> 00:47:38.303
We can keep it on the DL

818
00:47:38.338 --> 00:47:40.961
only if we've got a CHIS
inside MIT.

819
00:47:40.996 --> 00:47:43.032
Great. So either
I'm accused of being a traitor

820
00:47:43.067 --> 00:47:45.621
or I become one
to avoid being accused?

821
00:47:45.655 --> 00:47:47.588
Jesus Christ. Steve.

822
00:47:55.458 --> 00:47:57.495
I'm gonna have to think
about it.

823
00:47:57.529 --> 00:48:00.463
Cheers. Kate.
and that's all anyone can ask.

824
00:48:12.372 --> 00:48:14.005
The address
where Terry Boyle was arrested

825
00:48:14.029 --> 00:48:17.480
was covered in prints
matching Carl Banks.

826
00:48:34.083 --> 00:48:35.405
<i>One initial line
of inquiry in Vella</i>

827
00:48:35.429 --> 00:48:37.949
was a contract killing.

828
00:48:37.984 --> 00:48:39.571
According to my informant
on the Hill.

829
00:48:39.606 --> 00:48:41.515
Operation Lighthouse
has detected forensic evidence

830
00:48:41.539 --> 00:48:44.611
linking to this suspect.
Carl Banks.

831
00:48:44.645 --> 00:48:46.544
Carl Banks has an extensive
history of violence

832
00:48:46.578 --> 00:48:48.132
including firearms offences

833
00:48:48.166 --> 00:48:50.755
and a long association
with organised crime.

834
00:48:50.789 --> 00:48:52.377
It's much more likely
to be the gunman

835
00:48:52.412 --> 00:48:54.241
than the local oddball.
That's for sure.

836
00:48:54.276 --> 00:48:56.485
Yes. sir. It would appear
that if DCI Davidson

837
00:48:56.519 --> 00:48:58.038
deliberately delayed
the operation

838
00:48:58.073 --> 00:49:00.006
to arrest the suspect.
it's possible

839
00:49:00.040 --> 00:49:02.180
this was instrumental
in enabling Banks.

840
00:49:02.215 --> 00:49:03.802
the real killer. to flee.

841
00:49:03.837 --> 00:49:06.253
If we want to get to the
truth. there's no choice. sir.

842
00:49:06.288 --> 00:49:08.635
we've got to start formally
investigating Davidson.

843
00:49:08.669 --> 00:49:11.465
Well. that's what we do. son.

844
00:49:11.500 --> 00:49:13.295
We hunt the truth.

845
00:49:14.710 --> 00:49:16.574
Inquiry authorised.

846
00:49:18.334 --> 00:49:19.680
Thank you. sir.

847
00:49:22.166 --> 00:49:24.685
What are you waiting on.
a puff of white smoke?

848
00:49:24.720 --> 00:49:26.342
Sir.

849
00:50:19.395 --> 00:50:21.535
I thought we agreed
you'd be out?

850
00:50:21.570 --> 00:50:23.365
You don't even want to talk
about it?

851
00:50:23.399 --> 00:50:25.470
We've talked enough.

852
00:50:25.505 --> 00:50:28.646
I just want to get the last
of my things.

853
00:50:28.680 --> 00:50:30.855
I don't want a row. Farida.

854
00:50:30.889 --> 00:50:32.822
It's over.

855
00:50:44.558 --> 00:50:46.629
Farida. Please.

856
00:50:47.803 --> 00:50:49.598
You moving in with her now?

857
00:50:49.632 --> 00:50:50.875
"Her"?

858
00:50:50.909 --> 00:50:53.429
Smart money's on Kate Fleming.

859
00:50:53.464 --> 00:50:56.432
Kate and I have been shagging
on the sly for months

860
00:50:56.467 --> 00:51:00.091
even though she's straight
and I never cheated on you.

861
00:51:00.126 --> 00:51:01.748
Now I see why
you never made detective.

862
00:51:01.782 --> 00:51:03.922
Don't patronise me!

863
00:51:03.957 --> 00:51:05.545
You think you're so fantastic!

864
00:51:05.579 --> 00:51:06.891
You think you're so powerful!

865
00:51:06.925 --> 00:51:09.583
No. but at work I'm your boss.

866
00:51:09.618 --> 00:51:11.689
and I've still treated you
with respect

867
00:51:11.723 --> 00:51:13.829
the whole time you've
destroyed our relationship

868
00:51:13.863 --> 00:51:15.693
- with your paranoia.
- And out of work.

869
00:51:15.727 --> 00:51:18.247
what am I to you?

870
00:51:18.282 --> 00:51:19.904
You still act
like we're just friends.

871
00:51:19.938 --> 00:51:22.320
- You're ashamed of me!
- No. of course not.

872
00:51:22.355 --> 00:51:23.804
How come I've never met
your family?

873
00:51:25.806 --> 00:51:27.946
I don't have one.

874
00:51:27.981 --> 00:51:29.362
You're lying!

875
00:51:29.396 --> 00:51:31.709
Everyone has a family!

876
00:51:35.161 --> 00:51:37.611
This is why I'm leaving.

877
00:51:37.646 --> 00:51:40.166
This madness.

878
00:51:40.200 --> 00:51:42.168
I'm sorry. Jo.

879
00:51:43.203 --> 00:51:44.515
I'm sorry.

880
00:51:45.826 --> 00:51:47.794
I love you. Jo.

881
00:51:47.828 --> 00:51:51.384
Please don't go.

882
00:53:41.804 --> 00:53:44.497
Jo. he made a confession.

883
00:53:44.531 --> 00:53:45.912
It's not good enough. sir.

884
00:53:45.946 --> 00:53:47.338
No. this isn't good enough.

885
00:53:47.362 --> 00:53:48.604
This isn't good enough.

886
00:53:48.639 --> 00:53:50.606
This is your gig. Jo.

887
00:53:50.641 --> 00:53:51.883
Christ sake!

888
00:53:51.918 --> 00:53:53.344
I can see
you're frustrated. sir.

889
00:53:53.368 --> 00:53:54.748
Oh. really? Really?

890
00:53:54.783 --> 00:53:56.405
Thanks for that!

891
00:53:56.440 --> 00:53:57.786
Thanks a million!

892
00:53:57.820 --> 00:53:59.650
We need to consider next steps.

893
00:53:59.684 --> 00:54:01.790
Look. what am I
gonna tell the Chief?

894
00:54:01.824 --> 00:54:04.344
I've explained everything
clearly. sir.

895
00:54:04.379 --> 00:54:06.381
Would you like me to go
through it again?

896
00:54:33.787 --> 00:54:37.308
Boss? You okay?

897
00:54:37.343 --> 00:54:38.803
I just took the Super
through my decision

898
00:54:38.827 --> 00:54:41.381
on Terry Boyle.

899
00:54:41.416 --> 00:54:43.556
I've recommended he be put
on police bail pending

900
00:54:43.590 --> 00:54:44.971
further inquiries.

901
00:54:45.005 --> 00:54:47.111
I've released him
without charge.

902
00:54:48.354 --> 00:54:49.596
Right.

903
00:54:49.631 --> 00:54:51.598
Don't look so surprised. Kate.

904
00:54:51.633 --> 00:54:53.117
I wasn't born yesterday.

905
00:54:53.151 --> 00:54:54.567
The gun...

906
00:54:56.672 --> 00:54:59.365
The gunshot particles
aren't enough without spatter

907
00:54:59.399 --> 00:55:02.816
of Gail Vella's blood
or tissues.

908
00:55:02.851 --> 00:55:05.163
And the CHIS. Carl Banks.
Terry Boyle's flat.

909
00:55:05.198 --> 00:55:06.682
Something doesn't add up.

910
00:55:06.717 --> 00:55:08.650
Yeah. I agree. boss.

911
00:55:08.684 --> 00:55:11.135
I just want to catch the
bastard who killed Gail Vella.

912
00:55:11.169 --> 00:55:13.033
She's what this is all about.

913
00:55:13.068 --> 00:55:14.839
No way am I going after
someone like Terry Boyle.

914
00:55:14.863 --> 00:55:16.105
because he's the easy way out.

915
00:55:16.140 --> 00:55:17.555
Boss.

916
00:55:18.763 --> 00:55:20.317
is everything okay?

917
00:55:23.009 --> 00:55:24.597
Thanks. Kate.

918
00:55:28.980 --> 00:55:31.086
- I should. uh...
- Yeah.

919
00:55:54.143 --> 00:55:55.983
The police
need to know where you are

920
00:55:56.007 --> 00:55:58.493
at all times. and your flat's
still a crime scene.

921
00:55:58.527 --> 00:56:00.091
so they've arranged for you
to stay in what they call

922
00:56:00.115 --> 00:56:01.910
Approved Premises.

923
00:56:01.944 --> 00:56:03.498
You'll be safe there. Terry.

924
00:56:03.532 --> 00:56:05.879
Thank you.

